## Env Vars Cheat Sheet

### Vercel (Frontend)
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://ucf-backend.onrender.com
```

### Render (Backend)
```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxx.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
REDIS_URL=rediss://default:xxx@xxx.upstash.io:6379
JWT_SECRET=<generate-one>
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=<generate-one>
JWT_EXPIRY=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRY=7d
DEFAULT_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
DEFAULT_ADMIN_PASSWORD=<strong-password>
BACKEND_PORT=4000
NODE_ENV=production
CORS_ORIGIN=https://your-app.vercel.app
SCRAPE_INTERVAL_MINUTES=360
```

### Render (Scraper Worker)
```
DATABASE_URL=<same-neon-url>
REDIS_URL=<same-upstash-url>
SCRAPE_INTERVAL_MINUTES=360
SCRAPE_DELAY_SECONDS=2
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
```

