## Limits to Know

| Service | Key Limit | Ceiling |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| Vercel | 100 GB bandwidth/mo | Way more than you need |
| Render Web | Sleeps after 15 min idle | Upgrade to $7/mo Starter for always-on |
| Render Worker | 750 free hours/mo | Enough for 1 worker 24/7 |
| Neon | 0.5 GB storage, 190 compute-hr | Upgrade to $19/mo Pro |
| Upstash | 10K commands/day | Upgrade to $10/mo Pay-as-you-go |

> [!TIP]
> This entire stack costs **$0/mo** and handles a side project comfortably. When you outgrow it, each service has a clear paid upgrade path with no migration needed.

